Happy touch your Mac day! Apple's new PROLED <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-pro/">MacBook Pro</a> is now in the hands of customers. We picked up one of the new machines to get our greasy fingerprints all over that pristine <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/macbook-ultra/">OLED</a> display.<br/>
<br/>
